.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-mr-list 1  "swarm 0.1.0" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-mr\-list \- List open merge requests
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm mr list\fR [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-R\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-offline\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List open merge requests
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Include merged and closed ones
.TP
\fB\-R\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<REPO>\fR
A repo ID or link; by default the swarm remote of this clone
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-offline\fR
Use what is already here instead of syncing first
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
